  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fde912e761b7bed44b1e8695e4f7966f, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteHandler
  NoteCanvas: {fileID: 3853517053703398480}
  NoteTextMesh: {fileID: 4973818839614097686}
  playerCamera: {fileID: 0}
  itemOverlayCanvas: {fileID: 0}
  itemLookedAtText: {fileID: 0}
  NoteText: Listen closely, I'm running out of time. I've been trapped here for weeks.
    That damn door... the handle is rusted solid. It won't budge.  I tried everything.
    I thought I had to mix a complex acid in my test tubes to melt the metal. I wasted
    days on formulas. But I was wrong.  It doesn't work as a mixture. You need three
    specific items and you have to pour them <color=red> directly on the rusted handle</color>.
    One by one. Three reactions to break through the corrosion.  I wasted my last
    strength mixing useless concoctions. Don't make the same mistake. Find all three
    and smash them against that rust.
  playerMovementScript: {fileID: 0}
